 01: Sign-in on
 https://portal.azure.com/
 

02: Install Azure CLI
Install [Azure CLI) https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/cli/azure/install-azure-cli-windows?tabs-az
 Azure Version
-az version
Azure CLI Login
-az login
List Subscriptions
- az account list
Set Specific Subscription (if we have multiple subscriptions)
-az account set -subscription="SUBSCRIPTION_ID"

03: Install Visual Studio Code
Install [VS Code] https://code.visualstudio.com/download

04: Install ARM templates plugin

-Azure Resource Manager (ARM) Tools

05: Create ARM template with .json extension and select ARM template langauge

06: JQ Installation on GIT Bash

-curl -L -o /usr/bin/jq.exe https://github.com/stedolan/jq/releases/latest/download/jq-win64.exe
-jq --version
